  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Requires suitable terrain. Creates a 4.5m area of difficult terrain for {{math spellPower \"/\" 2}} turns. Movement or ending a turn in the area triggers a Will + {{math spellPower \"*\" 3}}) vs. Dexterity/Endurance  test (max once per turn). </p><p>On caster's success, the target cannot move. </p><p>Three failures bury the target.</p><p> If targets remain in the area when the spell ends, they become rooted. The caster cannot dismiss the spell early.</p>",
